Q: Slick slider issue: displaying thumbnails in vertical columns A: <p>The <a href="http://kenwheeler.github.io/slick/" rel="nofollow">documentation for Slick</a> allows you to manually refresh the positioning which is needed after your Bootstrap tab is visible.</p>

<p>Just add this to your <strong>Javascript</strong>:</p>

<pre><code>$(document).ready(function () {
  $('a[data-toggle="tab"]').on('shown.bs.tab', function (e) {
    $('.main-slick').slick('setPosition');
  });
});
</code></pre>

<p>Here is a <strong><a href="http://plnkr.co/edit/VNZidqA11TKdXMNX58tP?p=preview" rel="nofollow">Working Plunker</a></strong>.</p>
